{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17582","headline":"郡中即事三首 一 · 羊士谔","name":"郡中即事三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓风山郭雁飞初，霜拂回塘水榭虚。\n鼓角清明如战垒，梧桐摇落似贫居。\n青门远忆中人产，白首闲看太史书。\n城下秋江寒见底，宾筵莫讶食无鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}